do MouseManager.set_mouse_mode_visible()
do GameplayRound2Tracker.run_round_votes()
[i]A moment of silence passes before a voice returns over the intercom[/i]
Intercom: Thank you for voting. The results will now be displayed on your screen.
[i]You quickly check the results and see[/i]
Number of votes per participant\
Alastair\: {GameplayRound2Tracker.num_artsy_votes}
if {OpponentStatusTracker.jock_is_alive} == true:
	Frank\: {GameplayRound2Tracker.num_jock_votes}
if {OpponentStatusTracker.mean_is_alive} == true:
	Kelly\: {GameplayRound2Tracker.num_mean_votes}
if {OpponentStatusTracker.nerd_is_alive} == true:
	Damien\: {GameplayRound2Tracker.num_nerd_votes}
if {OpponentStatusTracker.nice_is_alive} == true:
	Melanie\: {GameplayRound2Tracker.num_nice_votes}
You\: {GameplayRound2Tracker.num_player_votes}
[i]The screen flickers and the display changes[/i]
Number of remaining lives per participant\
Alastair\: {GameplayRound2Tracker.artsy_lives}
if {OpponentStatusTracker.jock_is_alive} == true:
	Frank\: {GameplayRound2Tracker.jock_lives}
if {OpponentStatusTracker.nerd_is_alive} == true:
	Damien\: {GameplayRound2Tracker.nerd_lives}
if {OpponentStatusTracker.mean_is_alive} == true:
	Kelly\: {GameplayRound2Tracker.mean_lives}
if {OpponentStatusTracker.nice_is_alive} == true:
	Melanie\: {GameplayRound2Tracker.nice_lives}
You\: {GameplayRound2Tracker.player_lives}
if {GameplayRound2Tracker.player_lives} <= 0.0:
	jump player_loss
if {GameplayRound2Tracker.nice_lives} <= 0.0:
	jump nice_loss
if {GameplayRound2Tracker.jock_lives} <= 0.0:
	jump jock_loss
if {GameplayRound2Tracker.mean_lives} <= 0.0:
	jump mean_loss
if {GameplayRound2Tracker.nerd_lives} <= 0.0:
	jump nerd_loss
Intercom: As no player has been eliminated yet, we will continue to the next round of voting.
jump gameplay_vote_round_2/
label player_loss
[i]Everyone looks over at you in pity. You can feel the floor beneath you start to move. Who was it, who voted for you[/i]
[i]*KKKRRRRRRNK*[/i]
audio "res://Assets/Audio/Impacts Abyssal Thud 001.wav"
[i]The grating of the platform beneath you is the last thing you hear as you plunge into the abyss below[/i]
do GameplayerManager.go_to_loss_screen()
[end_timeline]
label nice_loss
Nice: NOOO! I didn't know, I didn't know not to vote. I panicked. Please, please don't do this.
[i]You look on, adrenline pumping as Melania fearfuly pleads.[/i]
[i]You hear a creaking of metal before a sudden...[/i]
audio "res://Assets/Audio/Impacts Abyssal Thud 001.wav"
[i]*KKKRRRRRRNK*[/i]
[i]The floor opens beneath her as she drops into the abyss below[/i]
do OpponentStatusTracker.opponent_died("nice")
do GameplayerManager.end_gameplay()
[end_timeline]
label jock_loss
Jock: What!! Nooo! Who the hell voted for me!
Jock: Whatever it doesn't matter, it's all just a prank. Right?
[i]The floor beneath him starts to groan. He looks down at his feet in growing anxiety[/i]
This is just a prank right? You.. you.. you guys wouldn't actually....
audio "res://Assets/Audio/Impacts Abyssal Thud 001.wav"
[i]*KKKRRRRRRNK*[/i]
[i]Before he can finish his sentence the floor beneath him violet snaps open, sending him into the abyss below[/i]
do OpponentStatusTracker.opponent_died("jock")
do GameplayerManager.end_gameplay()
[end_timeline]
label mean_loss
Mean: WHO DID IT! WHO VOTED ME!
Mean: WHEN I FIND OUT WHO DID THIS I'M GOING TO...
[i]Because of her yelling Kelly could not hear the floor beneath her start to creak. Suddenly she slammed her foot down and right at that moment.[/i]
audio "res://Assets/Audio/Impacts Abyssal Thud 001.wav"
[i]*KKKRRRRRRNK*[/i]
Mean: AAAAHHHHHHHHHHH!!!
[i]Her screams eventually fade as she is swallowed by the abyss below[/i]
do OpponentStatusTracker.opponent_died("mean")
do GameplayerManager.end_gameplay()
[end_timeline]
label nerd_loss
Nerd: No no no no! Why me?
[i]He looks around the room, seemingly trying to identify his executioners.[/i]
[/i]Suddenly he sees Melanie, he freezes for a moment as the ground beneath him starts to groan.[/i]
Nerd: YOU!! IT WAS YOOUU....
audio "res://Assets/Audio/Impacts Abyssal Thud 001.wav"
[i]*KKKRRRRRRNK*[/i]
[i]Damien is violently cut off as the ground beneath swings open. His face contorted in anger is eventually lost to the abyss below.[/i]
do OpponentStatusTracker.opponent_died("nerd")
do GameplayerManager.end_gameplay()
[end_timeline]